<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Palabora sets higher copper price for Dec.</title>
<headline>Palabora sets higher copper price for Dec.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-12-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Africa's internal copper price for electrolytic wirebars was fixed higher for December, Palabora Mining Co Ltd said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The price, excluding value-added tax (VAT), was fixed at 10,345.83 rand per tonne for December, up from November's 8,929.08 rand, the company said.</p>
<p>The VAT-inclusive price was 11,794.25 rand per tonne versus 10,179.15 for November.</p>
<p>The price &quot;FOR&quot; Palabora, is set monthly by Palabora Mining, South Africa's largest producer, in agreement with the rest of the industry.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom, +27 11 482-1003</p>
</text>
